# Inno Setup OutputDir=..\dist 相对 .iss 目录解析 → 产物落这里（dist/ 无前导斜杠已覆盖，显式声明防未来改成 /dist/）
scripts/dist/

benches/shootout/bench/out/
benches/shootout/out/

superpowers/
.superpowers

.env
docs/.env
.codegraph
.crush
.worktrees
# DSH AgentTeams 运行时状态（mailbox / team.json），非源码
.agent-teams
.z3/
pkg/
# 本地安装的 cargo-dist 二进制（仓库只 vendor 其生成的配置，RFC-037）
tools/cargo-dist/

# Wasm playground build artifacts
docs/src/.vitepress/public/wasm/*.wasm
docs/src/.vitepress/public/wasm/*.js

# TextMate grammar build artifacts (synced from vscode-extension/language-pack/syntaxes/)
docs/src/.vitepress/syntaxes/yaoxiang.tmLanguage.json

# i18n translation scripts
scripts/i18n/.env

# Ignore all files in the wasm directory, but not the directory itself
docs/public/wasm/*

# Reasonix AI assistant
.reasonix/
reasonix.toml

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
